// MVP, delete with PM-41067

//! Fills and inspects the focused field of the app in front on macOS:
//! - Enables `AXManualAccessibility` and `AXEnhancedUserInterface` on browser and Electron apps so
//!   `AXWebArea` exposes the live `https://…` tab URL (`AXURL` / `AXDocument`) without AppleScript
//!   Automation prompts, and focused inputs expose bounds, labels, and `AXSecureTextField`.
//! - Uses Raycast-style concealed transient paste (`org.nspasteboard.ConcealedType`,
//!   `org.nspasteboard.TransientType`, `org.nspasteboard.AutoGeneratedType`) + `⌘V` + 150 ms
//!   pasteboard snapshot restore so Vietnamese (`Nguyễn Thị Linh`) and Japanese (`東京都`) text
//!   fills intact under any active IME without appearing in clipboard history managers.

